<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALGERIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Algerian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Thurday, as reported by the official</p>
<p>Algerian news agency APS:</p>
<p> Sportif  Constantine    3   Chabab Belouizdad	  0</p>
<p> Utihad Mouloudia Alger  0   Association Ain M'lila   0</p>
<p> Jeunesse Kabylie	  2   Widad Tlemcen		3</p>
<p> Wifaq Mostaganem	  2   Chabab Batna		 0</p>
<p> Nadit Hussein Dey	 3   Mouloudia Oran	     4</p>
<p> Sportif Ain Beida	 2   Mouloudia Constantine    0</p>
<p> Widad Boufariq	    2   Mouloudia Club Alger     1</p>
<p> Utihad Chaouia	    2   Utihad el Harrach	  0</p>
</text>
